#### ONE X2: Camera Wi-Fi: Q2: What should I do if the phone can detect the ONE X2's signal, but the app cannot connect?

1.  Please go to the mobile phone system page to check whether the Wi-Fi is connected;

-   If it is not connected, please make sure that the entered Wi**\-**Fi password is 88888888, and restart the camera and mobile phone, then try again;
-   If the phone still cannot connect to the Wi-Fi, please click on the Wi-Fi, and try again after forgetting the network;
-   If it still fails, try other mobile devices to enter the password to connect to confirm whether it is the phone's issue or the camera's.

